{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33783","headline":"公斋四咏 小桂 · 皮日休","name":"公斋四咏 小桂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一子落天上，生此青璧枝。\n歘从山之幽，斸断云根移。\n劲挺隐珪质，盘珊缇油姿。\n叶彩碧髓融，花状白毫蕤。\n棱层立翠节，偃蹇樛青螭。\n影澹雪霁後，香泛风和时。\n吾祖在月竁，孤贞能见怡。\n愿老君子地，不敢辞喧卑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}